00:39:36.540 --> 00:39:40.510
our last barrier to the great tropics that promises warmth and peace.

00:39:41.870 --> 00:39:45.060
It's working! It's done! Look, it's working!

00:39:45.830 --> 00:39:46.910
Yeah, I told you you could do it.

00:39:48.220 --> 00:39:50.060
Well, you better get back there and fasten your seatbelt.

00:39:50.770 --> 00:39:59.840
It's the Inland Sea.

00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:04.010
Hang on, it's a long way across.

00:40:05.920 --> 00:40:06.860
Why not please sit down?

00:40:45.640 --> 00:40:47.100
Would you get me one of those protein pills, please?

00:40:47.510 --> 00:40:50.010
Mom gave us the last one just before we started out.

00:40:50.110 --> 00:40:50.850
I'm sorry, dear.

00:40:51.430 --> 00:40:53.330
We have some coffee pills. Shall I heat one for you?

00:40:53.430 --> 00:40:54.890
No, I'm not a bottle of sleep.

00:40:58.860 --> 00:40:59.980
Well, if we're not on...

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.940
Mars you tell us where we are I don't know for sure yet we might even be on

00:41:03.940 --> 00:41:04.220
servers

00:42:15.100 --> 00:42:15.560
We'll be right back.

00:42:32.240 --> 00:42:34.390
Well, you can hand me what I need.

00:42:36.460 --> 00:42:38.200
Jody, up front!

00:43:01.120 --> 00:43:02.480
Give me the solar wrench!

00:43:03.360 --> 00:43:04.620
Give me the solar wrench!

00:43:31.120 --> 00:43:31.780
See what it reads!

00:46:07.770 --> 00:46:08.050
So

00:46:39.630 --> 00:46:48.680
Just half ground. Try the power. I managed to make a connection.

00:46:50.180 --> 00:46:52.060
Lori, check the scope for the nearest landfall.

00:46:54.340 --> 00:46:57.520
All right, everybody. Here we go.

00:48:00.410 --> 00:48:02.960
December 8th in the year 2001.

00:48:04.830 --> 00:48:08.190
Our great adventure in the wild sea is now happily behind us.

00:48:09.250 --> 00:48:10.690
At last we've reached the tropics.

00:48:11.760 --> 00:48:13.950
The weather is warm, the vegetation lush,

00:48:14.690 --> 00:48:17.290
and the stillness of the air promises peaceful days.

00:48:18.380 --> 00:48:21.720
Yet so much has happened in our short stay on this strange planet

00:48:21.720 --> 00:48:23.600
that we take nothing for granted.

00:48:24.770 --> 00:48:27.570
We've experienced dangers unknown by earthbound men.

00:48:28.610 --> 00:48:29.710
We breathe easily now.

00:48:30.540 --> 00:48:31.380
but only for the moment.

00:48:32.530 --> 00:48:33.910
Our every instinct tells us

00:48:33.910 --> 00:48:37.380
there are wild, wonderful adventures just ahead.
